2026-07-27T12:26:36.1471560Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T12:26:36.1471889Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T12:26:36.1472442Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T12:26:36.1473225Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T12:26:36.1476811Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
